<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35175" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδημ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dwelling in</i> a place,
				<i>native</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				225
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				794
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. παρών</span> being
			here <i>at home</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				570
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδημότατοι</span>
			<i>the greatest 'stay-at-homes</i>', opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδημηταί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.70
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοὴ ἔ</span>. <i>intestine</i>
			war, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				683
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					8.83
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔ</span>.
			<i>homeaffairs</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ
			ὑπερόρια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1285b14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχαί</span> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερόριοι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				24.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.45
			</span></i>, Foed. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.47
			</span></i>; <i>endemic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					15.429
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				17(1).11
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔ. βιβλία</span>
			applied to the surgical treatises of Hippocrates, <i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i><i>in Hp.Fract.</i><i><span class="en">
				12.271C.
			</span></i></div>
